```javascript
function slugify(title) {
  return title
    .normalize('NFKD')
    .replace(/[\u0300-\u036f]/g, '') // strip accents
    .toLowerCase()
    .trim()
    .replace(/[^a-z0-9\s-]/g, '')
    .replace(/[\s_-]+/g, '-')
    .replace(/^-+|-+$/g, '');
}
```

Handles accents (café → cafe), punctuation, multiple spaces/hyphens collapsing to one, and trims leading/trailing dashes.

