```

If you need guaranteed uniqueness (e.g. for a database), append a short suffix when there's a collision rather than baking randomness into every slug:

```javascript
function uniqueSlug(title, existingSlugs) {
  const base = slugify(title);
  if (!existingSlugs.has(base)) return base;
  let i = 2;
  while (existingSlugs.has(`${base}-${i}`)) i++;
  return `${base}-${i}`;
}
```

